  "summary": "The most renowned painter is José Antonio Velásquez.",
  "description": "Art: The most renowned painter is José Antonio Velásquez. Other important painters include Carlos Garay, and Roque Zelaya. Notable writers include Lucila Gamero de Medina, Froylán Turcios, Ramón Amaya Amador and Juan Pablo Suazo Euceda, Marco Antonio Rosa, Roberto Sosa, Eduardo Bähr, Amanda Castro, Javier Abril Espinoza, Teófilo Trejo, and Roberto Quesada.\n\nThe José Francisco Saybe theater in San Pedro Sula is home to the Círculo Teatral Sampedrano (Theatrical Circle of San Pedro Sula) Honduras has experienced a boom from its film industry for the past two decades. Since the premiere of the movie \"Anita la cazadora de insectos\" in 2001, the level of Honduran productions has increased, many collaborating with countries such as Mexico, Colombia, and the United States. The most well known Honduran films are El Xendra, Amor y Frijoles, and Cafe con aroma a mi tierra.",
